  },
  {
   "id": "f011",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "$t^3u(t)$ 的傅里叶变换与拉普拉斯变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=-j\\pi\\delta^{\\prime\\prime\\prime}(\\omega)+\\frac{6}{\\omega^4}$；$L(s)=\\frac{6}{s^4}$",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f012",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "余弦信号 $\\cos(\\omega_1t)$ 的傅里叶变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=\\pi\\left[\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_1)+\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_1)\\right]$；双边拉普拉斯变换不存在（无公共收敛域）",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f013",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "单边余弦 $\\cos(\\omega_1t)u(t)$ 的变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=\\frac{j\\omega}{\\omega_1^2-\\omega^2}+\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\left[\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_1)+\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_1)\\right]$；$L(s)=\\frac{s}{s^2+\\omega_1^2}$",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f014",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "正弦信号 $\\sin(\\omega_1t)$ 的傅里叶变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=\\frac{\\pi}{j}\\left[\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_1)-\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_1)\\right]$；双边拉普拉斯变换不存在",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f015",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "单边正弦 $\\sin(\\omega_1t)u(t)$ 的变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=\\frac{\\omega_1}{\\omega_1^2-\\omega^2}+\\frac{\\pi}{2j}\\left[\\delta(\\omega-\\omega_1)-\\delta(\\omega+\\omega_1)\\right]$；$L(s)=\\frac{\\omega_1}{s^2+\\omega_1^2}$",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f016",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "周期冲激串 $\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta(t-nT_1)$ 的变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=\\frac{2\\pi}{T_1}\\sum_{n=-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\delta\\left(\\omega-\\frac{2n\\pi}{T_1}\\right)$；单边 $L(s)=\\frac{1}{1-e^{-sT_1}}$，$Re(s)>0$",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f017",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "双曲正弦 $sh(at)u(t)=\\frac{e^{at}-e^{-at}}{2}u(t)$ 的变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=-\\frac{a}{a^2+\\omega^2}$；$L(s)=\\frac{a}{s^2-a^2}$，$Re(s)>|a|$",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f018",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换对",
   "q": "双曲余弦 $ch(at)u(t)=\\frac{e^{at}+e^{-at}}{2}u(t)$ 的变换？",
   "a": "$F(\\omega)=-\\frac{j\\omega}{a^2+\\omega^2}$；$L(s)=\\frac{s}{s^2-a^2}$，$Re(s)>|a|$",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f019",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换性质",
   "q": "拉普拉斯变换的线性性质？",
   "a": "$ax_1(t)+bx_2(t)\\leftrightarrow aX_1(s)+bX_2(s)$，收敛域至少为两收敛域的交集；傅里叶变换同样成立",
   "tag": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "f020",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换性质",
   "q": "拉普拉斯变换的尺度变换性质？",
   "a": "$x(at)\\leftrightarrow\\frac{1}{|a|}X\\left(\\frac{s}{a}\\right)$，收敛域按 $|a|$ 缩放；傅里叶变换为 $\\frac{1}{|a|}X\\left(\\frac{\\omega}{a}\\right)$",
