   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "拉普拉斯变换性质",
   "q": "拉普拉斯变换的时域积分性质？",
   "a": "$\\int_{0}^{t}x(\\tau)d\\tau\\leftrightarrow\\frac{X(s)}{s}$（单边）；傅里叶为 $\\int_{-\\infty}^{t}x(\\tau)d\\tau\\leftrightarrow\\frac{X(\\omega)}{j\\omega}+\\pi X(0)\\delta(\\omega)$",
