   "id": "f124",
   "subject": "信号与系统",
   "sub": "Z变换对",
   "q": "$r^n\\sin(\\omega_0n)u[n]$ 的 Z 变换与收敛域？",
   "a": "$X(z)=\\frac{zr\\sin\\omega_0}{z^2-2rz\\cos\\omega_0+r^2}$，$|z|>r$",
